在VS环境下需要把  struct Student  *p；这句提前，就不会报错了

struct Student s1 = {"Alan", NULL};
	struct Student s2 = {"Ben", NULL};
	struct Student s3 = {"Cici", NULL};
	struct Student s4 = {"David", NULL};
	struct Student *p;

	s1.next = &s2;
	s2.next = &s3;
	s3.next = &s4;

讲真，一个if语句都不需要就能够遍历链表了，用while(p != NULL)
                                                                             {
                                                                                      printf();    p = p->next;
                                                                               }
照样能实现遍历
